WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.730
- New in theaters this
weekend, Abominable.

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.790
What will you see?

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.525
This is your Weekend Ticket.

00:00:05.525 --> 00:00:08.358
(energetic music)

00:00:14.382 --> 00:00:15.420
- Aah, Nai Nai!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.210
- You need to spend more
time here with your family!

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.090
- Ow!
- Where are you going?

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.250
- Be back before dinner.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.210
- Be careful out there!

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.043
- No boys!

00:00:22.043 --> 00:00:22.883
- Got it covered, bye!

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.773
I just want to escape.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.180
Dad always wanted me to travel the world.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.039
Someday.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:33.956
(melodious violin)

00:00:36.128 --> 00:00:37.094
(roaring)

00:00:37.094 --> 00:00:37.927
Huh?

00:00:37.927 --> 00:00:38.937
(roaring)
(gasp)

00:00:38.937 --> 00:00:42.104
(suspenseful strings)

00:00:44.032 --> 00:00:45.840
There's a yeti on my roof!

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.530
- The next film from Dreamworks
comes out this weekend,

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:49.720
Abominable.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:52.730
When Yi finds a scared escaped
yeti hiding at her hideout,

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.910
she decides to set off on an epic journey

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:56.620
to help it find it's family.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.750
Now Yi and her friends
must stay one step ahead

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.730
of the people who took
the yeti from it's home,

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.320
and hopefully make it with the help

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.590
of a little bit of magic.

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:05.470
This movie's for you if
you're looking for a movie

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.280
for the whole family this weekend,

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:10.230
you're a fan of any or all
of the Dreamworks films,

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.330
or if you're looking to
perfect your Dreamworks smile.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.760
You know the one, the one that's all,

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.347
the smile that's on all
the posters, this one.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.383
I can't do it.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:22.683
- [Male Cameraman] Good job, bud!

00:01:22.683 --> 00:01:23.516
- Thanks!

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.440
That is your weekend ticket.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.280
What will you see?

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.771
And check back next week for some Joker.

00:01:29.771 --> 00:01:33.529
(inspiring instrumental music)

